    print("\n" + "=" * 60)
    print("HELP - PacketShield v1.0")
    print("=" * 60)
    print("""
PacketShield is a real‑time IDS/IPS that detects and blocks network attacks.

FEATURES:
- Background packet capture and analysis
- Normal Monitoring Mode (stats + alerts)
- Live Packet Capture Mode (Wireshark-like view)
- Automatic IP blocking
- Persistent logs

